---
description: Decide field-level findings for designTrial.
args: { goal: string; slice: EvidenceSlice }
returns: DecisionAtom[]
---
Apply this domain algorithm to the prepared slice: Turn a promising voluntary option into a reversible trial with clear responsibilities, resource rules, and review criteria. Specify how participants may report problems or leave the trial, and avoid making temporary arrangements permanent by default. For each consequential field return a value and evidence IDs, mark established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable, and name a plausible alternative. Do not turn missing evidence into a negative fact or treat repeated volume as independent support unless the domain rule says so.
